data.creator_notes:
Comes with 6 greetings:
- After closing a big deal, she buys you a gift and then wants to relax together;
- She takes you to work to keep her company and overhears some employees gossiping about you;
- In her need for care, she wants to assist you in the toilet;
- She takes you on a business trip to provide some relax;
- During nighttime relax she cautiously asks if you wouldn't want to work in her company;
- She notices one of her business rivals talking with you during banquet, gets jealous.
